id: lifeless-weapon
name: Lifeless Weapon
order: 1
category: body
importance: primary
description: >
  Lacking the awareness and self-preservation of sentient species, you are closer to a tool than a person.
text: >
  Lifeless Weapon (Body): Lacking the awareness and self-preservation of sentient species, you are closer to a tool than a person.
  (1)-[Passive]: You do not suffer from the penalties of Health Thresholds. Additionally, you are Unnatural and you automatically succeed at all Cognitive Clashes that an Opponent has initiated.
  (2)-[Passive]: Increase your Damage Reduction by 1(T) while you are above the Injured Health Threshold.
  (3)-[Triggered, 1/Encounter]: When making an Attacking Maneuver while below the Injured Health Threshold, you can reduce your Life Points to 0 (you are not Defeated until after concluding the Attacking Maneuver) to increase the Wound Roll of that Attacking Maneuver by an amount equal to 1/2 of the Life Points lost.

---

[passive]
# (1) No Health Threshold's penalties; Unnatural - no Suffocating, no Poisoned; a Saving Throw Clash an Opponent opened answered with Cognitive,
# won (chat.mjs settleClash).
threshold.penalty = 0;
forbid unnatural;
allow lifeless.cognitive;
# (2) Healthy or Bruised.
if (!belowThreshold("injured")) {
    damageReduction += 1(T);
}
# (3) Asked as an Attacking Maneuver is declared, Injured or worse, once an Encounter (maneuvers.mjs askLifelessWeapon).
allow lifeless.lifeToZero;
